00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:32,180
Or might there even be a possible tension between it?

133
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:35,460
Right? And, again, so you can certainly imagine,

134
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,860
like a fully socialized medicine program

