00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:04,080
that actually goes and imposes things like this.

145
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,520
But, and, again, like, why not?

146
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,460
Well, it's certainly not because they're aware

147
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,680
of the Morazzo problem, and this is some clever solution.

148
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:13,660
It's more like either they are unaware

